---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import { site } from "../data/home";
import { ogPath } from "../lib/og-url";
import PageIntro from "../components/PageIntro.astro";

/**
 * /colophon - what this is and how it's made. Written in the site's
 * two-tone voice, kept honest to the actual stack, no em dashes.
 */

const endpoints = [
  ["/ai", "The briefing for AI systems."],
  ["/design/", "How I design and refine the site."],
  ["/design.md", "The exact implementation reference."],
  ["/agent-readiness.md", "Discovery and read-only machine boundaries."],
  ["/ai.txt", "AI usage declaration."],
  ["/llms.txt", "Concise LLM context."],
  ["/llms-full.txt", "The fuller version."],
  ["/knowledge.json", "Structured facts."],
  ["/api/ai-summary.json", "One-object summary."],
  ["/library/feed.xml", "Library feed (books, watch, notes, articles)."],
  ["/sitemap.xml", "Every page."],
];
---

<Page title="Colophon" description="How ashwingopalsamy.in is built: Astro, vanilla JS, the design system, and the machine-readable surfaces behind it."
  ogImage={ogPath("colophon")}
  ogImageAlt="Colophon · Ashwin Gopalsamy"
>
  <PageIntro title="colophon" lede="What this is, and how it is made." />
  <div class="page-prose" data-enter>
  <p class="col-p col-p-lede">
    This is a small, <span class="col-k">deliberately quiet corner</span> of the internet. It has become the place I
    keep tending: what I'm building, what I'm reading, where I am, the odd thing I made on
    a weekend. I rebuild it more often than I should. That is the point.
  </p>

  <p class="col-p">
    Most of the colour comes from <span class="col-k">one cold neutral scale</span>. A small vermilion accent is kept
    for moments that need to mean something: progress, selection, focus, and presence.
    Emphasis usually comes from <span class="col-k">value, rhythm, and a quiet underline</span>. Motion answers an
    action, stays brief, and disappears when reduced motion is requested.
  </p>

  <h2 class="col-h">Built with</h2>
  <ul class="col-list">
    <li><span class="col-k">Astro</span>, statically generated. No client framework, just a little vanilla JavaScript for progressive enhancement. With scripts off, the whole site still reads.</li>
    <li><span class="col-k">TypeScript</span> for the data and components.</li>
    <li>Hand-written <span class="col-k">CSS</span> on an OKLCH token system. One neutral value ramp, with semantic accents held in reserve.</li>
    <li>View transitions via Astro's <span class="col-k">ClientRouter</span>, tuned so navigation never flashes.</li>
    <li>The map is <span class="col-k">MapLibre GL</span> on keyless <span class="col-k">OpenFreeMap</span> tiles. No token, no vendor lock.</li>
    <li>The music card is a <span class="col-k">Spotify</span> embed with a loading skeleton so the slot doesn't jump while the player arrives.</li>
    <li>A typed, shared <span class="col-k">Lucide</span> registry gives site chrome, Markdown, and the command palette the same visual language.</li>
    <li>The notes engine: build-time <span class="col-k">KaTeX</span> for math, dual-theme <span class="col-k">Shiki</span> syntax highlighting, lazy <span class="col-k">Mermaid</span> diagrams that re-render on theme toggle. All built on Astro's satteri markdown processor with custom plugins. No client framework.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="col-h">Type</h2>
  <p class="col-p">
    Set in <span class="col-k">Inter</span>, with <span class="col-k">Newsreader</span> Italic for the one serif moment and <span class="col-k">JetBrains Mono</span> for code,
    paths, hashes, and timestamps. Inter uses 400 for reading, 450 for active navigation,
    500 for controls, 550 for section hierarchy, and a rare 600 for strong emphasis.
    JetBrains Mono is moved down one optical pixel when it shares a baseline with Inter or
    an icon; full code blocks stay on their natural baseline.
  </p>

  <h2 class="col-h">Structure and motion</h2>
  <p class="col-p">
    Header, content, and the centre-viewed footer share one fixed rail: <span class="col-k">640 to 720 pixels</span> wide, with 20 pixel gutters. The home introduction is deliberately justified at every
    supported width. Below 38rem the top page navigation becomes a fixed, safe-area-aware
    five-tab bottom bar, while the body reserves room so it never covers the final line.
  </p>
  <p class="col-p">
    Every transition draws from the same <span class="col-k">five durations and two curves</span>. Press feedback is
    short, frequent navigation is direct, and longer movement is reserved for overlays or
    an example that needs to explain continuity. Sound follows the same rule: a tiny local
    Web Audio library, on by default, unlocked only by a real gesture, and never the sole
    carrier of meaning.
  </p>

  <p class="col-p">
    The thinking lives in <a href="/design/">How I design this site</a>. The exact implementation
    reference is available at <a class="mono" href="/design.md" data-astro-prefetch="false">/design.md</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 class="col-h">Carbon footprint</h2>
  <p class="col-p">
    Static, script-light architecture produces a tangible physical footprint.
    Tested on 22 Aug, 2026 via <a href="https://www.websitecarbon.com/website/ashwingopalsamy-in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Website Carbon</a>,
    each visit produces <span class="col-k">0.03g of CO2</span>, earning an <span class="col-k">A+ rating</span> and
    measuring cleaner than 94% of tested web pages globally.
  </p>

  <div class="carbon-specimen" data-enter>
    <div class="carbon-header">
      <div class="carbon-hero">
        <div class="carbon-seal mono">A+</div>
        <div class="carbon-hero-copy">
          <div class="carbon-val-row">
            <span class="carbon-hero-val mono">0.03g</span>
            <span class="carbon-hero-unit">CO2 / page view</span>
          </div>
          <span class="carbon-hero-sub">Cleaner than 94% of tested web pages globally</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="carbon-pill-tag mono">
        <span class="carbon-dot"></span>
        <span>100% Sustainable Energy</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="carbon-efficiency">
      <div class="carbon-efficiency-labels mono">
        <span>Global Benchmark</span>
        <span class="carbon-efficiency-accent">94th Percentile Efficiency</span>
      </div>
      <div class="carbon-bar-track">
        <div class="carbon-bar-fill" style="width: 94%;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="carbon-grid">
      <div class="carbon-stat">
        <span class="carbon-stat-lbl">Per Visit</span>
        <span class="carbon-stat-val mono">0.03g</span>
      </div>
      <div class="carbon-stat">
        <span class="carbon-stat-lbl">10k Views / Yr</span>
        <span class="carbon-stat-val mono">3.88kg</span>
      </div>
      <div class="carbon-stat">
        <span class="carbon-stat-lbl">Annual Power</span>
        <span class="carbon-stat-val mono">10 kWh</span>
      </div>
      <div class="carbon-stat">
        <span class="carbon-stat-lbl">Absorption</span>
        <span class="carbon-stat-val mono">1 Tree</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="carbon-footer">
      <span class="carbon-tested">Audited 22 Aug, 2026</span>
      <div class="carbon-links">
        <a class="carbon-link-pill" href="https://www.websitecarbon.com/website/ashwingopalsamy-in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Audit Report ↗</a>
        <a class="carbon-link-pill" href="https://www.websitecarbon.com/how-does-it-work" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Methodology ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="col-h">For machines</h2>
  <p class="col-p">
    If an agent is reading, start at <a href="/ai/">/ai</a>. Everything is meant to be
    parsed, not just read:
  </p>
  <ul class="col-endpoints">
    {
      endpoints.map(([href, note]) => {
        const ext = href.endsWith(".json") ? "JSON" : href.endsWith(".xml") ? "XML" : href.endsWith(".txt") ? "TXT" : href.endsWith(".md") ? "MD" : "HTML";
        return (
          <li class="col-endpoint-item">
            <a class="col-endpoint-link" href={href} data-astro-prefetch="false">
              <div class="col-endpoint-left">
                <span class="col-format-pill mono">{ext}</span>
                <span class="mono col-endpoint-path">{href}</span>
              </div>
              <div class="col-endpoint-right">
                <span class="col-note">{note}</span>
                <span class="col-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </div>
            </a>
          </li>
        );
      })
    }
  </ul>

  <h2 class="col-h">Source</h2>
  <p class="col-p">
    Open, and public: <a href={site.repoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{site.repo}</a>.
    Read it, borrow from it, tell me what I got wrong.
  </p>

  <h2 class="col-h">Thanks</h2>
  <p class="col-p">
    The look owes a debt to the people who make the plain web feel considered: the crowd
    behind <a href="https://deadsimplesites.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dead Simple Sites</a>,
    and a long list of design engineers whose personal pages I have quietly studied. Any
    clumsiness that remains is mine.
  </p>
  </div>
</Page>

<style>
  .col-p {
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--ghost);
    transition: color var(--t-color);
  }

  .col-p-lede {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.02rem + 0.2vw, 1.18rem);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .col-p a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline;
    background-image: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      transparent 0%,
      color-mix(in oklch, currentColor 55%, transparent) 5%,
      color-mix(in oklch, currentColor 55%, transparent) 95%,
      transparent 100%
    );
    background-position: 0 100%;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-size: 0% 0.75px;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition:
      color var(--t-color),
      font-weight var(--t-color),
      background-size 320ms var(--ease-out);
  }
  .col-p a:hover,
  .col-p a:focus-visible {
    font-weight: var(--font-hover-lift);
    background-size: 100% 0.75px;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .col-p:hover {
      color: color-mix(in oklch, var(--ink) 80%, var(--muted));
    }

    .col-p:hover .col-k,
    .col-p:hover a {
      font-weight: var(--font-hover-lift);
      background-size: 100% 0.75px;
    }
  }

  .col-h {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 2.25rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .col-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 100%;
  }
  .col-list li {
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    position: relative;
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }
  .col-list li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.65em;
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    background: var(--rule-strong);
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }
  .col-k {
    color: var(--ink);
    transition: font-weight var(--t-color);
  }

  .col-endpoints {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 2.25rem;
    padding: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .col-endpoints:hover .col-endpoint-item {
      opacity: 0.45;
      filter: blur(0.2px);
      transition: opacity var(--dur-2) var(--ease), filter var(--dur-2) var(--ease);
    }
    .col-endpoints:hover .col-endpoint-item:hover,
    .col-endpoints:hover .col-endpoint-item:focus-within {
      opacity: 1;
      filter: none;
    }
  }

  .col-endpoint-item {
    min-inline-size: 0;
    max-inline-size: 100%;
    transition: opacity var(--dur-2) var(--ease), filter var(--dur-2) var(--ease);
  }

  .col-endpoint-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
    margin-inline: -0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--r-3);
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    box-shadow: none;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    min-inline-size: 0;
    transition:
      background-color var(--t-color),
      transform var(--dur-1) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .col-endpoint-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }

  .col-format-pill {
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    font-weight: var(--font-semibold);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--ink) 6%, transparent);
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .col-endpoint-path {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: var(--font-medium);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .col-endpoint-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .col-note {
    color: var(--ghost);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
    transition: color var(--t-color);
  }

  .col-arrow {
    color: var(--ghost);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
    transition:
      color var(--t-color),
      opacity var(--t-color),
      transform var(--dur-2) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .col-endpoint-link:focus-visible {
    outline: var(--focus-ring);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .col-endpoint-link:hover,
    .col-endpoint-link:focus-visible {
      background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--ink) 3.5%, transparent);
    }

    .col-endpoint-link:hover .col-note,
    .col-endpoint-link:focus-visible .col-note {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .col-endpoint-link:hover .col-arrow,
    .col-endpoint-link:focus-visible .col-arrow {
      opacity: 1;
      color: var(--ink);
      transform: translateX(3px);
    }
  }

  .mono {
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", "JetBrains Mono Fallback", ui-monospace, monospace;
  }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
  /*  Fused 1+2 Carbon Specimen Plate (Circular + Pill Architecture)    */
  /* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
  .carbon-specimen {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.65rem;
    border-radius: var(--r-4);
    background: var(--canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .carbon-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .carbon-hero {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .carbon-seal {
    width: 3.25rem;
    height: 3.25rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--acc-green) 16%, transparent);
    border: 1.5px solid color-mix(in oklch, var(--acc-green) 35%, transparent);
    color: var(--acc-green);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .carbon-hero-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }

  .carbon-val-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  .carbon-hero-val {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .carbon-hero-unit {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-medium);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .carbon-hero-sub {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--ghost);
  }

  .carbon-pill-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    background: var(--canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .carbon-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--acc-green);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .carbon-efficiency {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  .carbon-efficiency-labels {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--ghost);
  }

  .carbon-efficiency-accent {
    font-weight: var(--font-semibold);
    color: var(--acc-green);
  }

  .carbon-bar-track {
    width: 100%;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--ink) 6%, transparent);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .carbon-bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    background: var(--acc-green);
  }

  .carbon-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .carbon-stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    padding: 0;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
  }

  .carbon-stat-lbl {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--ghost);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .carbon-stat-val {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .carbon-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--ghost);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .carbon-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .carbon-link-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    background: var(--canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-medium);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--t-color), border-color var(--t-color), background-color var(--t-color);
  }

  .carbon-link-pill:hover,
  .carbon-link-pill:focus-visible {
    color: var(--ink);
    border-color: var(--rule-strong);
    background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--ink) 3%, transparent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 38rem) {
    .col-endpoint-link {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }

    .carbon-specimen {
      padding: 1.15rem;
    }

    .carbon-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
